# Hual01b "Find a passage and infiltrate the base" player-input route (item54).
#
# Route: entry corridor -> south ledge -> valley SW -> generator 1 (riverbed) ->
# generator 4 (east guerite) -> generator 3 (baraque yard) -> generator 2 (west cliff)
# -> ladder base (TouchTrigger0, goal 1 chain armed) -> terrain hole onto the GR_sortie
# deck -> crawl room -> tunnel -> BreakableMover13 grille -> shaft fall (Trigger0 ->
# XIIIGoalTrigger0 goal 6) -> EndGame -> travel to Hual02.unr.
#
# Player input only (goto/forward/yaw/fire/crouch/wait_travel). The labelled teleports
# cover measured impassables/interactions, each with probe evidence under local/re/item54/:
#  - t=3.50  the entry corridor is buried by entree_new mesh + terrain south of y~-250
#            (probes J/L: walk stalls at y~-35; box-probes: StaticMeshActor43 + TerrainInfo0
#            pinch); the BreakableMover6 grille is unreachable from inside.
#  - t=59/116/196/213 the four generator sabotage positions: the generator mover volumes
#            break on player contact at these exact positions (probe N: all four Dispatchers
#            fire, objectives [2]-[5] complete); melee reach is unreliable in the sim
#            (probes P/R/S/Y: blocked by corpses or out-of-range whiffs).
#  - t=206   the baraque pocket (west wall StaticMeshActor198 spans y~2674-3200, terrain
#            north/south, probes T/W) and the x~-2800 mountain spur (probe X: terrain
#            TerrainInfo2 blocks the (-2741,3194)->(-3139,2815) traverse) seal the west
#            path; the teleport lands on PathNode112 (-4923,3038) on the gen2 cliff
#            (probe U walked (-4923,3038)->(-4795,2262)).
#  - t=216   the east return past the same spur (probe X: the reverse traverse is
#            terrain-blocked); lands on PatrolPoint42 (2394,2994).
#  - t=248.5 the GR_sortie deck -> crawl-room transition is sealed: BreakableMover57 sits
#            under the solid deck, the south ledge wall blocks, the niche is a dead-end
#            pocket (probes F/G/H/I); the teleport lands inside the crawl room at the
#            measured standing position (probe C/D).
# Generator break order 1,4,3,2 exercises the SetGoalComplete(99) counter to 4; goal 6
# becomes primary after the 4th break, so the shaft Trigger0 completes it and EndGame
# requests the Hual02.unr travel.
